			"notes": "- fixed: new slides no longer adopt a neighbour's sketch cross-section - profiles fade to an explicit circle across the transition window, and removed curves no longer leave stale profiles behind\n- fixed: entry mspt spikes - water sim recalcs now wait for chunk streaming to settle instead of recomputing the whole park every cooldown window\n- fixed: pliers dial key hint is now localizable\n- added: seamless nine-slice tiling on slide surfaces - borders are cut from the interior, real border strips appear only at sector boundaries and curve mouths, per-sector cap rings keep their own materials"
		},
