			"notes": "- added: brass pliers - a precision drag editor over ccs control points (tangent, tilt, lift and radius handles) with cursor-exact hybrid plane dragging and snap-line ticks\n- added: hold ctrl with the pliers for the radial settings dial (alignment x direction x plane) as a camera-free hud overlay with ring labels, key hints and an item tooltip hint\n- added: live radius preview, drag readouts and neighbour snap markers shared with the wrench editors\n- fixed: waterslide handle lengths never synced to the client, lifted-anchor drags rendering on a split centre, and the radius handle fighting the wrench editor\n- added: missing drafting table model and sketch undo/redo icons from 0.2.7"
		},
